  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.58 Moose Pond. No person shall operate a motorboat on Moose Pond in the town of Pittsburg.\n\nSource. #2351, eff 4-25-83; ss by #3010, eff 5-2-85; ss by #4562, eff 1-3-89; ss by #5936, INTERIM, eff 1-3-95, EXPIRES: 5-3-95; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95; ss by #6815, eff 7-24-98); ss and moved by #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.45); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.53) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
